			shape: "pentagon"
			subtitle: "Welcome Power User!"
			description: [
				"&2Greetings new Power User! You have chosen or been chosen to be digitized fully into our FOPGame Server! We welcome you with open arms!"
				""
				"&2Here you will find many things to do, but our main attraction is Vault Hunters, which everything revolves around!"
				""
				"&2As you are digitzed into our GameServer, please be careful! As per the Terms of Service, Power Users maintain full control of their digital bodies, which includes our Survival System! Please take care and manage your Health, Oxygen, Sustenance, and all future systems!"
				""
				"&2The FOPGame Server has two major Zones : The Mainland, which consists of the Overworld, Nether, and End; and The Vaults, which are temporary portals into special worlds! "
				""
				"&2To continue, please follow the included Vault Hunter's Guidebook to get up to speed! Then submit (5) five Chromatic Iron Ingots to continue!"
			]
			dependencies: ["31711C6DAB9BA2E5"]
			hide: true
			id: "763620C2A16C72C1"
			tasks: [{
				id: "1F4FE22CFD352AEA"
				type: "item"
				item: "the_vault:chromatic_iron_ingot"
				consume_items: true
			}]
		}
		{
			title: "NEW PLAYER INTRODUCTION PART 2"
			x: -0.5d
			y: -2.0d
			shape: "pentagon"
			subtitle: "DLC For Your Benefit!"
			description: [
				"&2[Thank you for purchasing NEW PLAYER INTRODUCTION PART 2]"
				""
				"&2As you may have noticed, much of the game's content is not accessable to a new Power User. This is for your safety!"
				""
				"&2Our GameServer is a very in depth and complicated series of systems, and as such we must ensure you can synergize with things at a safe pace! Chapters within the Vault Hunters Guidebook will unlock at a manageable pace for a New Power User!"
				""
				"&2You are currently what we call an IR Power user! That stands for InfraRed, our starter Power User tier! You have access to range of basic recipes, the Mainland, and most importantly : The ability to enter Vaults! "
				""
				"&2[Please Insert Chromatic Iron to Continue]"
			]
